===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# {{lb|en|informal|usually|uncountable}} A [[thick]], [[slimy]] [[substance]]; [[goo]].
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Olivia Judson|authorlink=Olivia Judson|title=The hemiparasite season [print version: Under the hemiparasite, ''International New York Times'', 24–25 December 2014, page&nbsp;7]|url=http://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/24/opinion/the-hemiparasite-season.html|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20141223181330/https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/24/opinion/the-hemiparasite-season.html|archivedate=23 December 2014|newspaper={{w|The New York Times}}|date=23 December 2014|passage={{...}} The flesh [of the [[mistletoe]] berry] is sticky, and forms strings and ribbons between my thumb and forefinger. For the mistletoe, this viscous '''goop'''&nbsp;– and by the way, viscous comes to English from {{l|la|viscum}}&nbsp;– is crucial. The stickiness means that, after eating the berries, birds often regurgitate the seeds and then wipe their bills on twigs&nbsp;– leading to the seeds' getting glued to the tree, where they can germinate and begin the cycle anew.}}
# {{lb|en|countable|informal|derogatory|dated}} A [[silly]], [[stupid]], or [[boorish]] person.

